MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_001: Hup, hyah!
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_002: Rrah!
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_003: Oof... I yield. I should have known you'd get the\nbetter of me.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_004: I like to think I've trained myself well, but your\nspear work is far beyond what I can muster.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_005: There's no hesitation in your form. You remain\ncomposed, both in and out of battle.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_006: How do you stay so calm with the burden of saving\nthe world on your shoulders?
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_007: Hmm...
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_008: Sorry, I didn't mean to poke fun at you. It's just that\nI can relate to bearing weighty expectations.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_009: I come from a prestigious house of Saramis. I've\nworked hard to live up to my lineage.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_010: Those of noble birth must devote ourselves to our\nsubjects and kingdoms. The people expect results.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_011: And if that pressure is great for a minor noble of a\nsingle country, it must be many times worse for you.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_012: I can't imagine the strain you're under. Are you sure\nyou're alright?
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_013: <NCA>"Of course."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_014: <NCB>"No need to worry about me."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_015: <ACA>Again, no hesitation.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_016: <ACB>You sound so sincere in that. I take it to mean you\nwere prepared for such a monumental task.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_017: You have superhuman strength of spirit. Any normal\nperson would have buckled by now.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_018: <NCA>"I live for this duty."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_019: Ah. I see. Your duty is a heavy responsibility, but it\nalso drives you forward.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_020: Which is understandable. There were many moments\nwhen I wanted to abandon my studies or training.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_021: But my pride as a noble—and the duty that comes\nwith it—spurred me to press onward.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_022: So the same goes for you, then. I'm delighted\nto hear it.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_023: It may be presumptuous to say this to the Promised\nOne, but I feel a stronger bond with you now.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_A_024: Pardon me for asking such a strange question.\nLet us bear our weighty burdens together.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_001: Even now, the sky feels so distant and free. But you\nare no longer with us below it...
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_002: Did something just appear up there? Could— Could it\nhave been the Promised One?!
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_003: A fall from that height could be fatal! Please let me\nmake it there in time!
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_028: 
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_004: <NCA>"I didn't expect to appear in midair."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_005: Sorry, Promised One, but...would you mind getting\noff of me?
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_006: Your sudden disappearances and reappearances\nnever cease to surprise me.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_007: <NCA>"Sorry for landing on you."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_008: <NCB>"Thank you for catching me."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_009: <ACA>Apology accepted. I never thought your weight would\ncrush me too, but I've been training for this.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_010: <ACB>Hehe. You're quite welcome. All my training led me\nto that moment.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_011: I'm glad you're alive and well. It's a wonderful thing\nthat we could be reunited.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_012: <NCA>"I missed you too."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_013: You missed...me? I was the one you wanted to see?
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_014: Well, here I am. Is there anyone else you'd like to\nsee now that you're back?
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_015: Whatever you want, we'll pursue it. As many things\nas you can think of.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_016: Ah... I'm just worried. I still remember when you\nsaid you lived for your duty.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_017: And that duty was fulfilled when you saved the\nworld. I hope you haven't lost your reason to live.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_018: <NCA>"I have you, don't I?"
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_019: <NCB>"There are still people who need saving."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_020: <ACA>Me?! That's...very sweet of you. I'm honored.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_021: <ACA>The sky looks brighter, knowing that you think of me\nas a reason to live.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_022: <ACB>Good. I guess I was worrying over nothing.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_023: <ACB>Your journey will go on. The clear sky shining down\non us suggests we have its blessing.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_024: <NCA>"It's very beautiful."
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_025: Yes, it is. And so are you.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_026: <RSDS>I've always loved looking at the sky. Perhaps it was\nwhat led me to you.
MID_SE_Ism_Lys_S_027: Standing at your side, savoring the joy we've\nearned...it feels right.